# Provenance: evidence mirrored from the sibling repository

Copied byte-identical 2026-09-01 from CIRISAI/CIRISOntology so this
repository's banked claims are checkable from a clean clone of THIS repo.
Sources: scratchpad/crystal/ (instrument banked mid-run at Ontology
ac072ce) and scratchpad/qasm/ (adjudication records, tracked there).
The Ontology copies remain the originals; these are mirrors, and a
divergence between them is a defect in whichever moved.

